{"t":"CSX","made":"2026-11-10 08:51","name":"CSX Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Railroads","employees":21900,"hq":"Jacksonville, FL, United States","website":"https://www.csx.com","summary_en":"CSX Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, provides rail-based freight transportation services in the United States and Canada. It operates through two segments: rail and trucking. The company offers rail services; and transportation of intermodal containers and trailers, as well as other transportation services, such as rail-to-truck transfers and bulk commodity operations. It also transports chemicals, agricultural and food products, minerals, automotive, forest products, fertilizers, and metals and equipment; and coal, coke, and iron ore to electricity-generating power plants, steel manufacturers, and industrial plants, as well as exports coal to deep-water port facilities. In addition, the company provides intermodal services through a network of approximately 30 terminals transporting manufactured consumer goods in containers; and drayage services, including the pickup and delivery of intermodal shipments. It serves the automotive industry with distribution centers and storage locations, as well as connects non-rail served customers through transferring products, such as plastics and ethanol from rail to trucks. The company operates approximately 20,000 route mile rail network, which serves various population centers in 26 states east of the Mississippi River, the District of Columbia, and the Canadian provinces of Ontario and Quebec, as well as owns 3400 locomotives. It serves production and distribution facilities through track connections. CSX Corporation was incorporated in 1978 and is headquartered in Jacksonville, Florida.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"CSX Corporation은 자회사와 함께 미국과 캐나다에서 철도 기반 화물 운송 서비스를 제공합니다. 철도와 트럭 운송이라는 두 가지 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 회사는 철도 서비스를 제공합니다. 복합 컨테이너 및 트레일러 운송은 물론, 철도에서 트럭으로의 운송, 대량 상품 운영과 같은 기타 운송 서비스도 포함됩니다. 또한 화학 물질, 농산물 및 식품, 광물, 자동차, 임산물, 비료, 금속 및 장비를 운송합니다. 석탄, 코크스, 철광석을 발전 발전소, 철강 제조업체, 산업 플랜트에 공급하고 심해 항만 시설로 석탄을 수출합니다. 또한 회사는 제조된 소비재를 컨테이너로 운송하는 약 30개의 터미널 네트워크를 통해 복합 운송 서비스를 제공합니다. 복합 운송물의 픽업 및 배송을 포함한 운송 서비스. 유통 센터와 보관 장소를 통해 자동차 산업에 서비스를 제공할 뿐만 아니라 플라스틱 및 에탄올과 같은 제품을 철도에서 트럭으로 운송하여 철도 서비스를 받지 않는 고객을 연결합니다. 이 회사는 미시시피강 동쪽 26개 주, 컬럼비아 특별구, 캐나다 온타리오주 및 퀘벡주의 다양한 인구 밀집 지역에 서비스를 제공하는 약 20,000마일의 철도 네트워크를 운영하고 있으며 3,400대의 기관차를 소유하고 있습니다. 트랙 연결을 통해 생산 및 유통 시설을 제공합니다. CSX Corporation은 1978년에 설립되었으며 플로리다주 잭슨빌에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":50.48,"mcap":93054746624.0,"pe":26.291668,"fpe":21.576061,"peg":1.7451,"ps":6.2277303,"pb":6.4684777,"ev_ebitda":15.174,"div":1.14,"beta":1.108,"hi52":53.6,"lo52":33.63},"fin":{"rev":14942000128.0,"rev_g":0.12,"eps_g":0.538,"gross":0.47777998,"op":0.39258,"net":0.23966,"roe":0.26389,"fcf":2421499904.0,"cash":1604999936.0,"debt":19440001024.0,"de":135.169,"eps":1.92,"feps":2.33963},"own":{"short":0.0217,"inst":0.81852996,"insider":0.00223},"analyst":{"n":23,"mean":53.80739,"median":54.57,"high":60.0,"low":32.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.92,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":4,"buy":13,"hold":6,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":4,"buy":13,"hold":6,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":4,"buy":13,"hold":6,"sell":1,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-27","Firm":"Susquehanna","ToGrade":"Positive","FromGrade":"Positive","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":60.0,"priorPriceTarget":55.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-23","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":54.0,"priorPriceTarget":53.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-22","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":60.0,"priorPriceTarget":54.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-22","Firm":"B of A Securities","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","pr